### Join request conflict - expected 409 (pending request for same student+hostel)
POST http://localhost:4003/requests/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "aea9cdc8-3d7b-4c41-9e43-bbd607c9d764",
  "type": "HOSTEL_JOIN",
  "details": {
    "hostelId": "db4954b0-8337-4b60-a10e-32786d437ce3"
  }
}

### Join request bad request - expected 400 (missing required fields)
POST http://localhost:4003/requests/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "",
  "type": "HOSTEL_JOIN",
  "details": {}
}

