### Get requests by student - expected 200
GET http://localhost:4003/requests/student/aea9cdc8-3d7b-4c41-9e43-bbd607c9d764

### Get a request by id - replace {id} - expected 200
GET http://localhost:4003/requests/{id}

### Update request status (approve) - expected 200 (requires Authorization header with Bearer token)
PATCH http://localhost:4003/requests/{id}/status?status=APPROVED&reviewedBy=warden1
Authorization: Bearer {token}


### Delete request - expected 204
DELETE http://localhost:4003/requests/{id}

